    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、【2024 武汉工程大学 4.4】设系统输入信号为 $x(t)$ , 输出信号为 $y(t)$ , 因果LTI 系统的微分方程如下: $y''(t) + \\frac{3}{2} y'(t) + \\frac{1}{2} y(t) = 5x(t)$ , 已知 $y(0^-) = 1$ , $y'(0^-) =$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            136,
            813,
            185
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "0, $x(t) = e^{-3t}u(t)$ , 求:",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            192,
            383,
            211
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) 求零输入响应 $y_{zi}(t)$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            217,
            394,
            235
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) 求零状态响应 $y_{zs}(t)$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            241,
            396,
            260
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) 求全响应 $y(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            194,
            266,
            349,
            283
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解: $\\alpha^{2}+\\frac{3}{2}\\alpha+\\frac{1}{2}=(\\alpha+1)(\\alpha+\\frac{1}{2})=0$ $\\alpha_{1}=-1, \\quad \\alpha_{2}=-\\frac{1}{2}$",
        "bbox": [
            450,
            185,
            808,
            244
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) $y_{2i}|t| = Ae^{-t} + Be^{-\\frac{1}{2}t}$ $y_{2i}(t+1) = y_{10-1} = A + B = 1$ $y_{2i}(t+1) = y_{10-1} = -A - \\frac{1}{2}B = 0 \\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} A = -1 \\\\ B = 2 \\end{cases}$ $\\therefore y_{2i}(t) = (-e^{-t} + 2e^{-\\frac{1}{2}t})u(t)$ (2) $y_{2sh}(t) = Ce^{-t} + De^{-\\frac{1}{2}t}$ $5x(t) = 5e^{-3t}u(t)$ 自由项 $t > 0$ 时自由项 $= 5e^{-3t}$ ，故 $y_{2xp}(t) = Ee^{-3t}$ $9Ee^{-3t} - \\frac{9}{2}Ee^{-3t} + \\frac{9}{2}e^{-3t} = 5e^{-3t}$ E = 1 $y_{xp}(t) = e^{-3t}$ $y_{x}(t) = Ce^{-t} + De^{-\\frac{1}{2}t} + e^{-3t}$ 自由项中无 $\\delta(t)$ 或 $\\delta(t)$ 参际项，故无初始化\n\n即 $y_{x}(t+1) = y_{x}(t-1) = C + D + 1 = 0$ $y'_{x}(t+1) = y'_{x}(t-1) = -C - \\frac{1}{2}D - 3 = 0$ $\\Rightarrow C = -5, D = 4$ $\\Rightarrow y_{x}(t) = (-5e^{-t} + 4e^{-\\frac{1}{2}t} + e^{-3t})u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            485,
            245,
            932,
            762
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {(3)} & {y | t | = y _ {2 i} | t | + y _ {x} | t |} \\\\ & {= (- 6 e ^ {- t} + 6 e ^ {- \\frac {1}{2} t} + e ^ {- 3 t}) (u | t)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
