        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "设初始 $y''(0_{-})=5,\\quad y'(0_{-})=-1,\\quad y(0_{-})=1$ ，输入为 $3e^{-t}u(t)$ ，求零输入响应 $y_{zi}(t)$ ，零状态响应 $y_{zs}(t)$ ，全响应 $y(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            372,
            810,
            416
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解:设中间度量9(10),如图示",
        "bbox": [
            166,
            418,
            490,
            458
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {q ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t)} & {= f (t) - 7 q ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) - 1 0 q ^ {\\prime} (t) \\Rightarrow f (t) = q ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 7 q ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 1 0 q ^ {\\prime} (t)} \\\\ {y (t)} & {= 5 q (t) + 5 q ^ {\\prime} (t)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            216,
            435,
            865,
            564
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\Rightarrow$ 微分方程为",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            570,
            364,
            609
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny ^ {\\prime \\prime} | t | + 7 y ^ {\\prime \\prime} | t | + 1 0 y | t | = 5 f | t | + 5 f | t |\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            403,
            554,
            828,
            612
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\alpha^ {3} + 7 \\alpha^ {2} + 1 0 \\alpha = \\alpha (\\alpha^ {2} + 7 \\alpha + 1 0) = \\alpha (\\alpha + 2) (\\alpha + 5) = 0\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            248,
            595,
            905,
            655
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\alpha_ {1} = 0, \\alpha_ {2} = - 2, \\alpha_ {3} = - 5\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            280,
            653,
            605,
            690
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {2 i} (t) = A _ {1} e ^ {0 t} + A _ {2} e ^ {- 2 t} + A _ {3} e ^ {- 5 t} = A _ {1} + A _ {2} e ^ {- 2 t} + A _ {3} e ^ {- 5 t}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            240,
            679,
            853,
            737
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {2 1} (0 +) = y (0 -) = A _ {1} + A _ {2} + A _ {3} = 1\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            240,
            739,
            578,
            775
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {2 1} ^ {\\prime} (v + 1) = y ^ {\\prime} (v - 1) = - 2 A _ {2} - 5 A _ {3} = - 1\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            240,
            771,
            579,
            813
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {2 1} ^ {\\prime \\prime} (0 + 1) = y ^ {\\prime \\prime} (0) = 4 A _ {2} + 2 5 A _ {3} = 5\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            240,
            809,
            579,
            847
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nA _ {3} = \\frac {1}{5}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            717,
            794,
            813,
            833
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {i} (t) = (\\frac {4}{5} + \\frac {1}{5} e ^ {- 5 t}) u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            278,
