        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "和 $y_{x}(t)$ 在 t=0 处也连续 $y_{x}(2+) = y_{x}(2) = 0$",
        "bbox": [
            450,
            344,
            895,
            383
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {B} (0 + 1) = B _ {1} + B _ {2} + B _ {3} = 0\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            265,
            399,
            606,
            441
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {x} (v + 1) = - 2 B _ {2} - 5 B _ {3} = 0\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            268,
            442,
            551,
            486
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{l} {B _ {1} = \\frac {3}{2}} \\\\ {B _ {2} = - \\frac {5}{2}} \\\\ {B _ {3} = 1} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            673,
            391,
            766,
            520
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny ^ {\\prime} x (0 +) = 4 B _ {2} + 2 5 B _ {3} = 1 5\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            272,
            486,
            561,
            526
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\therefore y _ {x} (t) = (\\frac {3}{2} - \\frac {5}{2} e ^ {- x t} + e ^ {- 3 t}) u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            248,
            526,
            653,
            574
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny _ {| t |} = y _ {2 i} (t) + y _ {4 i} (t) = \\left(\\frac {2 3}{1 0} - \\frac {5}{2} e ^ {- 2 t} + \\frac {6}{5} e ^ {- 5 t}\\right) u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
