    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、【2024重庆大学6.2】已知某LTI系统, $y''(t)+5y'(t)+6y(t)=x''(t)+3x'(t)+$",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            108,
            806,
            125
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$2x(t)$ ，已知 $x(t) = 3(1 + e^{-t})u(t)$ ，其中全响应 $y(t) = (4e^{-2t} + 3e^{-3t} + 1)u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            133,
            803,
            150
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "求：求 $y(0^{-})$ ， $y'(0^{-})$ 。（请用时域方法求解）",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            161,
            556,
            178
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【解析】",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            188,
            223,
            207
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "由输入:",
        "bbox": [
            141,
            223,
            220,
            239
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nx (t) = 3 \\left(1 + e ^ {- t}\\right) u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            423,
            254,
            611,
            271
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "求一阶导：",
        "bbox": [
            139,
            283,
            240,
            302
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nx ^ {\\prime} (t) = 3 \\delta (t) - 3 e ^ {- t} u (t) + 3 e ^ {- t} \\cdot \\delta (t) = 6 \\delta (t) - 3 e ^ {- t} u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            277,
            318,
            757,
            337
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "求二阶导：",
        "bbox": [
            139,
            349,
            240,
            366
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nx ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) = 6 \\delta^ {\\prime} (t) + 3 e ^ {- t} u (t) - 3 \\delta (t) = 6 \\delta^ {\\prime} (t) + 3 e ^ {- t} u (t) - 3 \\delta (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            257,
            382,
            778,
            402
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "则：",
        "bbox": [
            139,
            415,
            176,
            432
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{c} x ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 3 x ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 x (t) = 6 \\delta^ {\\prime} (t) + 3 e ^ {- t} u (t) - 3 \\delta (t) + 1 8 \\delta (t) - 9 e ^ {- t t} u (t) + 6 (1 + e ^ {- t}) u (t) \\\\ = 6 \\delta^ {\\prime} (t) + 1 5 \\delta (t) + 6 u (t) \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            447,
            889,
            500
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "设：",
        "bbox": [
            139,
            511,
            176,
            529
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{c} y ^ {\\prime} (t) = a \\delta^ {\\prime} (t) + b \\delta (t) + c \\Delta u (t) \\\\ y ^ {\\prime} (t) = a \\delta (t) + b \\Delta u (t) \\\\ y (t) = a \\Delta u (t) \\end{array} \\right.\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            349,
            545,
            685,
            611
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "得到：",
        "bbox": [
            139,
            624,
            198,
            641
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{c} y ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 5 y ^ {\\prime} (t) + 6 y (t) = a \\delta^ {\\prime} (t) + b \\delta (t) + c \\Delta u (t) + 5 a \\delta (t) + 5 b \\Delta u (t) + 6 a \\Delta u (t) \\\\ = 6 \\delta^ {\\prime} (t) + 1 5 \\delta (t) + 6 u (t) \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            657,
            850,
            709
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解得：",
        "bbox": [
            139,
            722,
            200,
            739
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{c} a = 6 \\\\ b + 5 a = 1 5 \\end{array} \\right. \\Rightarrow \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{c} a = 6 \\\\ b = - 1 5 \\end{array} \\right.\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            406,
            752,
            631,
            783
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "则：",
        "bbox": [
